  title: "G\xF6zlem Kayd\u0131 \u2014 Denek 7"
  body: "Toplama: sorunsuz.\nHaf\u0131za: temiz.\n\u0130lk tepki: beklenen aral\u0131kta.\n\nEv ortam\u0131ndaki not kald\u0131r\u0131lmam\u0131\u015F.\nSorumlu personel uyar\u0131ld\u0131."
